6/" title="DSC_0905p by Alastair Montgomery, on Flickr"&gt;&lt;img src="http://farm5.static.flickr.com/4047/4709348436_888ec5e445.jpg" width="500" height="389" alt="DSC_0905p" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:85%;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Alastair Montgomery&amp;rsquo;s Photography&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>8/52 Tweet Deck Overload</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/852-tweet-deck-overload/</link><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2009 10:51:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/852-tweet-deck-overload/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/3992766526/" title="photo sharing"&gt;&lt;img src="http://farm4.static.flickr.com/3093/3992766526_1ef9d2b7f1_m.jpg" alt="" style="border: solid 2px #000000;" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style=" margin-top: 0px;font-size:0.9em;"&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/3992766526/"&gt;8/52 Tweet Deck Overload&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Originally uploaded by &lt;a href="http://www.flickr.com/people/doodle_m/"&gt;Alastair Montgomery&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;p&gt;Taken with my LG Renoir, played with in Photoshop&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>40 Incredibly Inspirational Retro &amp; Vintage Photoshop Tutorials</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/40-incredibly-inspirational-retro/</link><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2009 11:14:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/40-incredibly-inspirational-retro/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt; 70 of this post&amp;rsquo;s 85 links are now broken — mostly deleted or made-private Flickr photos, dead Flickr &lt;code&gt;farmN&lt;/code&gt; subdomains, and defunct feed-syndication infrastructure. Left as originally published.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Worth a look&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;div style="margin: 0px 2px; padding-top: 1px; background-color: #c3d9ff; font-size: 1px !important; line-height: 0px !important;"&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div style="margin: 0px 1px; padding-top: 1px; background-color: #c3d9ff; font-size: 1px !important; line-height: 0px !important;"&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div style="padding: 4px; background-color: #c3d9ff;"&gt;&lt;h3 style="margin:0px 3px;font-family:sans-serif"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div style="margin: 0px 1px; padding-top: 1px; background-color: #c3d9ff; font-size: 1px !important; line-height: 0px !important;"&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div style="margin: 0px 2px; padding-top: 1px; background-color: #c3d9ff; font-size: 1px !important; line-height: 0px !important;"&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div style="font-family:sans-serif;overflow:auto;width:100%;margin: 0px 10px"&gt;&lt;h2 style="margin: 0.25em 0 0 0"&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;&lt;a href="http://feedproxy.google.com/~r/24thfloor/~3/ejKTrWMYyzU/"&gt;40 Incredibly Inspirational Retro &amp;amp; Vintage Photoshop Tutorials&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;div style="margin-bottom: 0.5em"&gt;via &lt;a href="http://www.hongkiat.com/blog" class="f"&gt;hongkiat.com&lt;/a&gt; by hongkiat on 8/17/09&lt;/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="http://hongki.at/images/ps_retro_vintage/vintage-retro-photoshop-tutorials.jpg" alt="retro vintage photoshop tutorials" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;The memories of yesteryears invoke in us a sense of nostalgia as we long for the days gone by when life seems so much simpler. Technology was not as advanced as it is today, and things were changing at a slower pace. Retro and vintage years usually refer to the decades before our present day, up to the last century. Images of the early 1900s to the 1980s comes into mind as we think about the designs of this era. Even though retro and vintage designs, as the names suggest, are technically outdated, many of us still turn to them for inspiration. These designs are still very much appreciated today due to its nostalgic value.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;For this very reason, we have combed the web for a number of Photoshop tutorials on retro and vintage designs. Enjoy the list and be inspired!&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.vileworks.com/photoshop-tutorial-old-fantasy-map-of-your-area"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Old Fantasy Map&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;via Vile Works&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.vileworks.com/photoshop-tutorial-old-fantasy-map-of-your-area"&gt;&lt;img src="http://hongki.at/images/ps_retro_vintage/oldmap1.jpg" width="500" height="446" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.tutorial9.net/photoshop/create-a-retro-pop-style-wallpaper/"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Abstract Retro-Pop Wallpaper&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;via Tutorial 9&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.tutorial9.net/photoshop/create-a-retro-pop-style-wallpaper/"&gt;&lt;img src="http://hongki.at/images/ps_retro_vintage/retro.PNG" width="500" height="211" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.tutorial9.net/photoshop/create-burnt-parchment-from-scratch/"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Realistic Burnt Parchment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.tutorial9.net/photoshop/create-burnt-parchment-from-scratch/"&gt;&lt;img src="http://hongki.at/images/ps_retro_vintage/burntpaper.jpg" alt="" width="500" height="516" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.pstut.info/tutorials/design-a-3d-retro-strip/"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3D Retro Strip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;via Photoshop Tuto&lt;/span&gt;r&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.pstut.info/tutorials/design-a-3d-retro-strip/"&gt;&lt;img src="http://hongki.at/images/ps_retro_vintage/curvefinal.jpg" width="500" height="418" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.computerarts.co.uk/tutorials/2d__and__photoshop/creating_the_new_retro"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creating the New Retro&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;via Computer Arts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.computerarts.co.uk/tutorials/2d__and__photoshop/creating_the_new_retro"&gt;&lt;img src="http://hongki.at/images/ps_retro_vintage/7.jpg" width="500" height="464" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://10steps.sg/photoshop/creating-an-awesome-retro-collage/"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Awesome Retro Collage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;via 10 Steps&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://10steps.sg/photoshop/creating-an-awesome-retro-collage/"&gt;&lt;img src="http://hongki.at/images/ps_retro_vintage/final.jpg" width="500" height="372" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://10steps.sg/photoshop/create-a-retro-pop-art-in-photoshop/"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retro Pop Art&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://10steps.sg/photoshop/create-a-retro-pop-art-in-photoshop/"&gt;&lt;img src="http://hongki.at/images/ps_retro_vintage/enlarge.jpg" width="500" height="550" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.denisdesigns.com/blog/2009/04/create-a-retro-photo-and-background/"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retro Photo with Background&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;via Denis Designs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.denisdesigns.com/blog/2009/04/create-a-retro-photo-and-background/"&gt;&lt;img src="http://hongki.at/images/ps_retro_vintage/retrophotofinal.jpg" width="500" height="316" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.online-photoshoptutorials.com/2008/09/creating-a-retro-grunge-poster.html"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retro Grunge Poster&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;via Photoshop Tutorials&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.online-photoshoptutorials.com/2008/09/creating-a-retro-grunge-poster.html"&gt;&lt;img src="http://hongki.at/images/ps_retro_vintage/posterfinished.